{"path":"/b2b-web-design/","slug":"b2b-web-design","kind":"landing","title":"B2B Web Design Agency | Legency Media","description":"B2B web design from a Webflow Enterprise partner: a site that convinces the whole buying committee, passes procurement, and reports what it earned every month.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Services</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>B2B Web Design</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>When a large prospect looks you up before the call, the site should say these people can handle our contract. We build B2B sites that convince the whole buying committee, pass procurement, and report what they earned every month.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Buying Committee</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Why B2B Sites Lose Deals Before the First Call</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M21 3.6V20.4C21 20.7314 20.7314 21 20.4 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V3.6C3 3.26863 3.26863 3 3.6 3H20.4C20.7314 3 21 3.26863 21 3.6Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The template could be any competitor’s</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Swap the logo and the site could belong to any competitor. Generic templates carry generic messaging, and a prospect comparing four vendors has no reason to remember yours.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M15 4V2M15 4V6M15 4H10.5M3 10V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21H19C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V10H3Z\"/><path d=\"M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H7\"/><path d=\"M7 2V6\"/><path d=\"M21 10V6C21 4.89543 20.1046 4 19 4H18.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>It launches, then sits untouched for two years</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A redesign launches, gets celebrated, and then sits untouched for two years while the market moves on. Nobody owns what happens after launch, and the site slowly stops describing what the company sells.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M6 6L18 6\"/><path d=\"M6 10H18\"/><path d=\"M13 14L18 14\"/><path d=\"M13 18L18 18\"/><path d=\"M2 21.4V2.6C2 2.26863 2.26863 2 2.6 2H21.4C21.7314 2 22 2.26863 22 2.6V21.4C22 21.7314 21.7314 22 21.4 22H2.6C2.26863 22 2 21.7314 2 21.4Z\"/><path d=\"M6 18V14H9V18H6Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Procurement paperwork gets bolted on late</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Security questionnaires, contract paper and compliance pages get bolted on after the fact, if at all. Enterprise buyers notice, and the deal stalls in legal for a quarter.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Everyone on the committee finds their answer</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The practitioner, the budget holder, security and the sceptic each find the page written for them, so the champion has something to forward and the deal keeps moving.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M10 12H5C4.44772 12 4 11.5523 4 11V7.5C4 6.94772 4.44772 6.5 5 6.5H9C9.55228 6.5 10 6.94772 10 7.5V12ZM10 12C10 14.5 9 16 6 17.5\"/><path d=\"M20 12H15C14.4477 12 14 11.5523 14 11V7.5C14 6.94772 14.4477 6.5 15 6.5H19C19.5523 6.5 20 6.94772 20 7.5V12ZM20 12C20 14.5 19 16 16 17.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Proof a sceptic can verify</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Every number carries its source and its window. A buyer who can check one claim stops discounting the rest of the page, and the true parts start doing the convincing.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Procurement never becomes the blocker</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Security posture, contract paper and compliance pages are part of the build. The security reviewer finds the answers before asking, and the deal that reached legal keeps its momentum.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The Engagement</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>What Marketing Gets From a B2B Build</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Site Your Team Can Change</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Built as a component library by a Webflow Enterprise partner, so a new page, a pricing change or a case study goes live without a ticket to engineering.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Report You Can Forward</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Rankings, conversion rate and AI citations tracked every month in one report, written to go to a CEO or board as it is. The spend defends itself.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M1 20V19C1 15.134 4.13401 12 8 12V12C11.866 12 15 15.134 15 19V20\"/><path d=\"M13 14V14C13 11.2386 15.2386 9 18 9V9C20.7614 9 23 11.2386 23 14V14.5\"/><path d=\"M8 12C10.2091 12 12 10.2091 12 8C12 5.79086 10.2091 4 8 4C5.79086 4 4 5.79086 4 8C4 10.2091 5.79086 12 8 12Z\"/><path d=\"M18 9C19.6569 9 21 7.65685 21 6C21 4.34315 19.6569 3 18 3C16.3431 3 15 4.34315 15 6C15 7.65685 16.3431 9 18 9Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Pages in the Order Buyers Evaluate</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Proof, process and procurement signals shown in the order a B2B committee looks for them, so the site reads like a vendor that has passed review before.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>The Committee</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>B2B Sites Are Read by People Who Never Enquire</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>A B2B purchase is agreed by several people, and most of them arrive after the champion forwards a link. A site written only for the champion gives them nothing to forward, which is where most B2B deals quietly stall.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>The practitioner</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Wants to know whether it does the specific thing they need, and how much of their week it will take to run. Answered by depth: real detail, real screenshots, no marketing abstraction.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>The budget holder</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Wants the shape of the cost and what happens if it does not work. Answered by posture: how pricing is structured, what a term looks like, and what the exit is. Silence here reads as expensive.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Security and procurement</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Wants to know whether you will pass review. Answered by a page that exists before they ask: certifications, data handling, subprocessors, insurance, and paper you have signed before.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>The sceptic</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Has been sold this before and is looking for the catch. Answered by specificity: numbers with methods attached, and an honest account of what the thing does not do.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section dp dp--alt\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Proof</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Generic Proof Discounts the True Parts</h2></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Four logos and a quote</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>A logo strip proves someone signed a contract, not that anything worked. A testimonial with no number in it is a sentence the vendor wrote and the client approved. Buyers know this, so they discount all of it, including the parts that are true.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>A number with a method</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>\"Named in 16 of 56 AI answers in its category, on a fixed question set re-run every month\" can be checked. Naming the source and the window is what turns a claim into evidence, and it costs nothing except the discipline to publish only what you can stand over.</p></article></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><p class=\"dp__foot\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>The practical test we use: could a sceptical reader verify this, or at least see exactly how it was measured? If not, it comes off the page.</p></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Build</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Built as Components Your Team Can Change</h2></div><div class=\"container dp__cards dp__cards--three\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>A new page in hours</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Campaign pages, new service pages and industry variants come out of the same component set, so marketing stops queueing behind a development sprint for a page that is mostly copy.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>One change, everywhere</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>A positioning shift or a new CTA updates once and lands across every page using that component. On a hand-built site the same change is a fortnight of find-and-replace and a page you missed.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri><h3 data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>Still maintainable in year two</h3><p data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri>The system is the thing that decays. Kept clean, a two-year-old build is still cheap to change. Left alone, it becomes the rebuild you paid to avoid.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/blueflame-2026.svg\" alt=\"Blueflame AI\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Eighteen months on, marketing still runs the site.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Blueflame’s marketing team runs its site on a component library we built once and have extended for over eighteen months. Organic search now brings more demo requests than paid, and every month closes with an evidence report a leadership team can read in five minutes.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-1440.webp\" alt=\"Blueflame’s new homepage and logo on an Apple Studio Display in a city office.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With the Committee</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out Who Your Site Is Currently Losing</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Most B2B sites answer the champion and nobody else on the committee. A call about who else has to say yes where you sell, and what a site that speaks to all of them looks like.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>What the budget holder, the sceptic and the security reviewer find today</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Which proof on the page is checkable and which is being discounted</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>A build marketing can actually change without a developer</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/b2b-website-redesign/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>If you are considering a redesign</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How is B2B web design different from a typical marketing site?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>B2B buying involves several stakeholders, longer cycles and procurement scrutiny. A B2B site has to convince a whole committee, most of whom arrive after the champion forwards a link, so proof, process and security signals carry more weight than they would on a consumer site. The site is often the first place a large prospect decides whether the company can handle its contract.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you redesign existing sites or only build new ones?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Both. Most engagements start as a redesign: we audit what exists, keep what already ranks and converts, and rebuild the rest as a component system your marketing team can add pages to without a developer.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What does procurement-ready mean in practice?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It means the site carries the trust signals enterprise buyers look for before they book a call: security posture, a clear process, and contract paper ready to sign. We have cleared a 36-question enterprise cyber due diligence and bill through corporate accounts payable ourselves, so the pages are written by people who know what the reviewer asks.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you measure a B2B website after launch?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Rankings, conversion rate and AI citations, tracked monthly and reported in one document written to be forwarded to a CEO or board as it is. A site that is measured every month keeps its budget; one that stops being measured after launch has to be defended on taste.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".dp__grid[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{gap:var(--sp-5);grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;display:grid}.dp__heading[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{font-size:var(--h4);margin-bottom:var(--sp-3);max-width:24ch}.dp__text[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri] p[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri],.dp__sub[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{font-size:var(--para-sm);max-width:56ch;margin-bottom:var(--sp-2)}.dp__note[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{opacity:.7}.dp__head[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{margin-bottom:var(--sp-4);max-width:64ch}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{background:var(--white)}.dp__cards[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{gap:var(--sp-3);grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));display:grid}.dp__cards--three[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--sp-4)}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri] .dp__card[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{background:var(--bg)}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri] h3[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{font-size:var(--h6);margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);max-width:26ch}.dp__card[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri] p[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{font-size:var(--para-sm)}.dp__steps[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{gap:var(--sp-2);list-style:none;display:grid}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{gap:var(--sp-4);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:var(--sp-4);grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);display:grid}.dp--alt[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri] .dp__step[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{background:var(--bg)}.dp__num[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{font-family:var(--font-title);font-weight:500;font-size:var(--h6);color:var(--blue);line-height:1}.dp__step[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri] h3[data-astro-cid-fn4v7sri]{font-size:var(--h6);ma